meta {
  name: The agent machine's shell control stream (Server-Sent Events)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/shell/agent/events
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  The agent mailbox's own credential only. Events: shell.hello {ca_public_key, ca_fp, broker_url}, shell.request {session_id, leg_token, broker_url, requester, via, mode, client_key_fp, cert_serial, ca_fp, principal, connect_by, ends_by, idle_secs}, shell.revoke {session_id, reason}. Holding it is what connected means.
}
